## Event Rules

Domain events must:

- Represent meaningful business changes
- Be immutable after publication
- Contain relevant business information
- Preserve domain traceability

## Event Handling

Consumers of domain events must:

- Respect event contracts
- Avoid modifying event history
- Handle unknown future events safely

## Security Considerations

Events must:

- Avoid exposing sensitive information
- Protect private data
- Support secure auditing
